meta {
  name: POST /api/trucks/attach-to-pan
  type: http
  seq: 3
}

post {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/api/trucks/attach-to-pan
  body: json
  auth: bearer
}

headers {
  Content-Type: application/json
}

auth:bearer {
  token: {{adminStaticToken}}
}

body:json {
  {
    "panNumber": "",
    "truckIds": [9810, 9811, 9813, 9814, 9820]
  }
}

docs {
  `TruckResource.attachTrucksToPan` (plutus-java `common/controller/TruckResource.java:476`), called as VAHN_ADMIN.
  Moves the listed trucks onto the PAN with this `panNumber` (the PAN must already exist, e.g. from create-additional-pan).
  Side effect: for every truck that is VERIFIED and has a driver, it queues fuel card creation with no provider,
  which tries IOCL first and falls back to BPCL (`defaultProviderOrder` in config.yml), using the driver's phone.
  Fuel card creation keys on the truck's PAN, so run this before create-iocl-fuel-card when switching PANs.
}
